00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:10.703
HERE NOW EXCLUSIVELY IS DIE

00:02:10.704 --> 00:02:11.571
DIANE COLEMAN.

00:02:11.572 --> 00:02:14.674
I'M SO SORRY FOR YOUR LOSS AND

00:02:14.675 --> 00:02:16.342
WHAT YOU'RE GOING THROUGH.

00:02:16.343 --> 00:02:19.245
OF COURSE, BAMBI'S SON, WHO

00:02:19.246 --> 00:02:20.613
UNDOUBTEDLY IS TOO

00:02:20.614 --> 00:02:21.814
GRIEF-STRICKEN TO SPEAK.

00:02:21.815 --> 00:02:23.716
TELL ME ABOUT HER.

00:02:23.717 --> 00:02:24.284
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:24.285 --> 00:02:25.818
I WOULD LOVE TO TELL YOU.

00:02:25.819 --> 00:02:27.387
FIRST OF ALL, THANK YOU FOR

00:02:27.388 --> 00:02:28.588
HAVING ME, LAURA.

00:02:28.589 --> 00:02:30.356
THANK YOU FOR COVERING THIS

00:02:30.357 --> 00:02:31.524
STORY BECAUSE EVERYTHING YOU

00:02:31.525 --> 00:02:33.426
JUST SAID IS WHAT I'VE BEEN

00:02:33.427 --> 00:02:34.761
FEELING FOR 2 1/2 WEEKS.

00:02:34.762 --> 00:02:36.863
I WOULD LOVE TO TELL YOU AND

00:02:36.864 --> 00:02:38.731
YOUR AUDIENCE ABOUT MY BEAUTIFUL

00:02:38.732 --> 00:02:41.334
FRIEND, BAMBI LARSON.

00:02:41.335 --> 00:02:44.671
SHE WAS ONE OF THE KINDEST,

00:02:44.672 --> 00:02:47.040
GENTLEST, CLASSIEST, MOST DECENT

00:02:47.041 --> 00:02:49.676
PEOPLE THAT I HAD THE HONOR OF

00:02:49.677 --> 00:02:51.411
SAYING WAS MY FRIEND.

00:02:51.412 --> 00:02:55.348
WE MET AS YOGA STUDENTS IN 2004.

00:02:55.349 --> 00:02:55.915
15 YEARS AGO.

00:02:55.916 --> 00:02:58.418
AND THEN I BECAME HER TEACHER,

00:02:58.419 --> 00:03:01.187
AND THEN WE BECAME FRIENDS.

00:03:01.188 --> 00:03:03.890
BAMBI WAS A WOMAN WHO WAS MY

00:03:03.891 --> 00:03:05.024
TRUE FRIEND.

00:03:05.025 --> 00:03:07.160
SHE SHOWED UP FOR ME IN REALLY

00:03:07.161 --> 00:03:09.262
GOOD TIMES IN MY LIFE, AND SHE

00:03:09.263 --> 00:03:12.332
SHOWED UP FOR ME IN REALLY HARD

00:03:12.333 --> 00:03:13.333
TIMES.

00:03:13.334 --> 00:03:15.769
AND THE THING THAT I FEEL WAS

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.404
ESPECIALLY EXTRAORDINARY IS THAT

00:03:17.405 --> 00:03:23.043
I NEVER HAD TO ASK THIS WOMAN TO

00:03:23.044 --> 00:03:24.311
SHOW UP FOR ME.

00:03:24.312 --> 00:03:27.314
SHE NEEDS ME TO SHOW UP FOR HER

00:03:27.315 --> 00:03:27.714
NOW.

00:03:27.715 --> 00:03:29.149
IF YOU WILL INDULGE ME, I WOULD

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.984
LIKE TO TELL YOU A REALLY

00:03:30.985 --> 00:03:32.052
PERSONAL STORY THAT WILL GIVE

00:03:32.053 --> 00:03:35.021
YOU AN IDEA OF JUST WHO SHE WAS.

00:03:35.022 --> 00:03:39.626
SO I MAINLY TAUGHT BAMBI IN A

00:03:39.627 --> 00:03:40.494
LARGE CLASS CAPACITY.

00:03:40.495 --> 00:03:41.828
BUT FIVE YEARS AGO, MY FAMILY

00:03:41.829 --> 00:03:44.331
AND I MOVED AND I HAD THE

00:03:44.332 --> 00:03:47.901
OPPORTUNITY TO HAVE MY OWN VERY

00:03:47.902 --> 00:03:51.972
SMALL YOGA STUDIO IN MY

00:03:51.973 --> 00:03:52.339
BASEMENT.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:55.008
I COULD NOT BEG, BORROW OR STEAL

00:03:55.009 --> 00:03:56.243
TO GET PEOPLE TO COME TO CLASS

00:03:56.244 --> 00:03:58.412
AND I WAS A WOMAN WHO HAD

00:03:58.413 --> 00:03:59.747
THOUSANDS OF YOGA STUDENTS.

00:03:59.748 --> 00:04:01.282
&gt;&gt; LAURA: WHAT DID SHE DO FOR

00:04:01.283 --> 00:04:01.548
YOU?

00:04:01.549 --> 00:04:03.851
&gt;&gt; EXCEPT FOR BAMBI LARSON, SO

00:04:03.852 --> 00:04:06.253
BAMBI LARSON CAME TO MY HOME

00:04:06.254 --> 00:04:07.588
STUDIO TWO TIMES EVERY WEEK.

00:04:07.589 --> 00:04:10.291
NOW, THAT'S NICE ENOUGH, RIGHT?

00:04:10.292 --> 00:04:12.626
BUT SHE ACTUALLY HAD THIS

00:04:12.627 --> 00:04:14.295
INCREDIBLE DECENCY TO EMAIL ME

00:04:14.296 --> 00:04:16.030
AND REGISTER ONLINE FOR EVERY

00:04:16.031 --> 00:04:18.132
CLASS SHE TOOK, AND SHE WOULD

00:04:18.133 --> 00:04:20.467
ASK, IN THOSE EMAILS, IF I MIGHT

00:04:20.468 --> 00:04:23.270
HAVE SPACE FOR BAMBI LARSON.

00:04:23.271 --> 00:04:24.772
CAN YOU IMAGINE THAT?

00:04:24.773 --> 00:04:26.273
&gt;&gt; LAURA: SHE'S A TRUE FRIEND.

00:04:26.274 --> 00:04:27.374
&gt;&gt; SHE WAS A TRUE FRIEND.

00:04:27.375 --> 00:04:28.542
&gt;&gt; LAURA: IT'S HARD TO FIND

00:04:28.543 --> 00:04:28.842
THEM.

00:04:28.843 --> 00:04:30.778
I HAVE TO ASK YOU TO SPEAK FOR

00:04:30.779 --> 00:04:33.247
HER, IF YOU COULD SAY ONE THING

00:04:33.248 --> 00:04:34.381
TO THESE COUNTY OFFICIALS THAT

00:04:34.382 --> 00:04:36.317
ARE TRYING TO PASS THE BLAME.

00:04:36.318 --> 00:04:36.917
&gt;&gt; SURE.

00:04:36.918 --> 00:04:39.420
&gt;&gt; LAURA: TO A GOVERNMENT AGENCY

00:04:39.421 --> 00:04:40.955
THAT HAD NINE TIMES REQUEST THIS

00:04:40.956 --> 00:04:42.690
GUY BE HELD UNTIL THEY COULD

00:04:42.691 --> 00:04:44.391
PICK HIM UP AND GET HIM

00:04:44.392 --> 00:04:45.292
PROCESSED OUT OF THE COUNTRY AND

00:04:45.293 --> 00:04:46.627
THEY NEVER TURNED HIM OVER,

00:04:46.628 --> 00:04:48.362
WHAT'S YOUR MESSAGE TO THESE

00:04:48.363 --> 00:04:49.630
LOCAL OFFICIALS?

00:04:49.631 --> 00:04:51.432
&gt;&gt; I'M HAPPY TO SPEAK FOR BAMBI.

00:04:51.433 --> 00:04:52.366
SHAME ON YOU.

00:04:52.367 --> 00:04:54.368
YOU HAVE BLOOD ON YOUR HANDS.

00:04:54.369 --> 00:04:55.970
THERE IS NO REASON THIS

00:04:55.971 --> 00:04:57.238
BEAUTIFUL, INCREDIBLE HUMAN

00:04:57.239 --> 00:04:58.506
BEING SHOULD HAVE BEEN BUTCHERED

00:04:58.507 --> 00:05:00.841
THE WAY THAT SHE WAS, IN HER OWN

00:05:00.842 --> 00:05:02.376
BED, IN HER OWN HOME.

00:05:02.377 --> 00:05:03.511
DEFENSELESS AS SHE COULD BE.

00:05:03.512 --> 00:05:05.313
AND WHAT I WAS TRYING TO FINISH,

00:05:05.314 --> 00:05:07.782
LAURA, WAS TO TELL YOU, WHAT

00:05:07.783 --> 00:05:10.217
BAMBI DID FOR ME IN 2014 AND

00:05:10.218 --> 00:05:12.687
2015, IS SHE RESTORED MY DIGNITY

00:05:12.688 --> 00:05:15.089
AT A TIME IN MY LIFE WHERE IT

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.591
HAD BEEN STRIPPED FOR OTHER

00:05:16.592 --> 00:05:17.158
REASONS.

00:05:17.159 --> 00:05:18.926
I'M HERE TONIGHT TO RESTORE HERS

00:05:18.927 --> 00:05:20.728
BECAUSE SHE WAS KILLED.

00:05:20.729 --> 00:05:23.164
SHE WAS MURDERED IN THE MOST

00:05:23.165 --> 00:05:24.232
UNDIGNIFIED WAY POSSIBLE.

00:05:24.233 --> 00:05:26.401
AND THAT'S NOT OKAY WITH ME.

00:05:26.402 --> 00:05:27.235
AND I DON'T WANT TO HEAR THAT

00:05:27.236 --> 00:05:28.503
SHE'S A ONE OFF.

00:05:28.504 --> 00:05:30.572
I DON'T WANT TO HEAR THE BUCK

00:05:30.573 --> 00:05:31.906
BEING PASSED FROM ONE DEPARTMENT

00:05:31.907 --> 00:05:32.674
TO THE NEXT.

00:05:32.675 --> 00:05:35.743
I WANT PEOPLE TO KNOW THIS WAS A

00:05:35.744 --> 00:05:38.212
REAL PERSON WHO DESERVED TO BE

00:05:38.213 --> 00:05:39.781
SAFE IN HER OWN BED.

00:05:39.782 --> 00:05:41.449
SHE WAS LAW-ABIDING.

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:42.550
SHE WAS A TAX PAYING CITIZEN.

00:05:42.551 --> 00:05:43.818
SHE WAS A HOMEOWNER.

00:05:43.819 --> 00:05:44.552
SHE WAS A MOTHER.

00:05:44.553 --> 00:05:47.155
SHE WOULD HAVE LOVED TO HAVE

00:05:47.156 --> 00:05:48.556
BECOME A GRANDMOTHER.

00:05:48.557 --> 00:05:49.457
SHE WAS INCREDIBLE.

00:05:49.458 --> 00:05:51.192
SHE WAS AS GOOD AS SHE LOOKS IN

00:05:51.193 --> 00:05:52.360
THE PHOTOGRAPH THAT I HAVE

00:05:52.361 --> 00:05:55.163
PROVIDED FOR YOU.

00:05:55.164 --> 00:05:57.465
&gt;&gt; LAURA: SHE HAS THAT WARMTH.

00:05:57.466 --> 00:05:58.066
SHE EXCEEDS.

00:05:58.067 --> 00:06:00.201
