00:06:00.202 --> 00:06:03.471
SHE JUST EXCEEDS, HAPPY, NICE

00:06:03.472 --> 00:06:04.539
PERSON, WHICH YOU CAN SEE.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:05.306
&gt;&gt; HAPPY.

00:06:05.307 --> 00:06:05.873
NICE.

00:06:05.874 --> 00:06:06.407
OPEN.

00:06:06.408 --> 00:06:07.775
&gt;&gt; LAURA: I HAVE TO ASK YOU

00:06:07.776 --> 00:06:10.011
