00:06:16.318 --> 00:06:17.919
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU KIDDING?

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:18.453
OF COURSE.

00:06:18.454 --> 00:06:20.755
AND THE BEST PART ABOUT BEING ON

00:06:20.756 --> 00:06:22.857
YOUR SHOW IS I WANT PRESIDENT

00:06:22.858 --> 00:06:24.492
TRUMP'S EAR AND HE IS MY

00:06:24.493 --> 00:06:24.959
PRESIDENT.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:27.829
AND I'M PROUD TO CALL HIM THAT.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:29.297
AND THERE ARE GOOD HEARTED

00:06:29.298 --> 00:06:31.232
CALIFORNIANS WHO THINK THIS IS

00:06:31.233 --> 00:06:32.634
CRAZY, IMMIGRANT FRIENDS OF MINE

00:06:32.635 --> 00:06:34.169
AMONG THEM WHO THINK THIS IS

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:35.203
CRAZY BECAUSE IT IS.

00:06:35.204 --> 00:06:37.372
PEOPLE TELL ME THAT I'M

00:06:37.373 --> 00:06:40.175
COURAGEOUS TO SPEAK, THIS IS NOT

00:06:40.176 --> 00:06:40.508
COURAGE.

00:06:40.509 --> 00:06:41.943
THIS IS A RIGHT AND WRONG AND

00:06:41.944 --> 00:06:45.447
THERE IS -- IT'S ABSOLUTELY

00:06:45.448 --> 00:06:48.683
BLACK AND WHITE.

00:06:48.684 --> 00:06:50.418
IT'S BEYOND COMMON SENSE.

00:06:50.419 --> 00:06:52.087
SHE WAS RAISED BY GOOD PARENTS.

00:06:52.088 --> 00:06:53.255
&gt;&gt; LAURA: WE'RE OUT OF TIME BUT

00:06:53.256 --> 00:06:54.356
WE'LL FOLLOW THIS STORY.

00:06:54.357 --> 00:06:56.992
I'M SURE WE'LL HAVE YOU BACK.

00:06:56.993 --> 00:06:59.060
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:06:59.061 --> 00:07:00.095
&gt;&gt; LAURA: --

00:07:00.096 --> 00:07:01.963
&gt;&gt; MY MESSAGE IS, PLEASE,

